# Mirror pointer

This file mirrors **`firestore.rules`** (canonical multi-org security rules).

- Edit and review: `./firestore.rules`
- Deploy: `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules`
- Docs: `docs/ACCESS_CONTROL.md`, `docs/ORGANIZATION_WORKSPACES.md`, `docs/FIRESTORE.md`

Do not maintain a separate rules copy here — keep this pointer in sync with the statement above when the canonical path changes.
